(2191472, 301569, 42984, '<td valign="top">The challenge was to ... "Use a non-stationary light source (for example, a moving flashlight in your hand)" but this light looks stationary (from top-left). That''s a major pity because I really really like this pic. Its beautifully composed, is sharp and has very simple and clean lines with that lovely burst of golden colour thrown in.</td>', 'The challenge was to ... "Use a non-stationary light source (for example, a moving flashlight in your hand)" but this light looks stationary (from top-left). That''s a major pity because I really really like this pic. Its beautifully composed, is sharp and has very simple and clean lines with that lovely burst of golden colour thrown in.', '2006-03-01 01:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
