(2193037, 301693, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea for a shot. Would have been miles better, in my opinion, if she''d been standing straighter and wearing something more appropriate. Because she''s on a third line, because she''s illuminated, and because she''s in the middle of the circles, the eye is drawn right to her body (actually, mine goes straight to her bottom and tummy), and her baggy low-rise jeans, exposed midriff, and seeming slouching posture detract from the otherwise quite interesting shot you''ve set up. <br/> <br/>P.S. I''d have liked to see it without the outside light on as well.</td>', 'Interesting idea for a shot. Would have been miles better, in my opinion, if she''d been standing straighter and wearing something more appropriate. Because she''s on a third line, because she''s illuminated, and because she''s in the middle of the circles, the eye is drawn right to her body (actually, mine goes straight to her bottom and tummy), and her baggy low-rise jeans, exposed midriff, and seeming slouching posture detract from the otherwise quite interesting shot you''ve set up.  P.S. I''d have liked to see it without the outside light on as well.', '2006-03-01 12:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
