(2194039, 299257, 39465, '<td valign="top">I thought there would be photos in the challenge to remind us of Fantasia <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=55938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/180/thumb/55938.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/180/thumb/55938.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/180/thumb/55938.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>This one is done quite well, though there are some elements that don''t come together (it''s very clear that the roller is not touching the wall. The light trail isn''t visible enough, and the painter''s hand is illuminated bright than it really should be.  Very good though. 7</td>', 'I thought there would be photos in the challenge to remind us of Fantasia   This one is done quite well, though there are some elements that don''t come together (it''s very clear that the roller is not touching the wall. The light trail isn''t visible enough, and the painter''s hand is illuminated bright than it really should be.  Very good though. 7', '2006-03-01 17:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
