(2195201, 301759, 46336, '<td valign="top">There is something fasinating about this that just keeps me looking. I lack the critical eye to say exactly what, but at least appreciate that it''s got something. Not sure I like the blowout, but then maybe that is part of what is holding my attention.</td>', 'There is something fasinating about this that just keeps me looking. I lack the critical eye to say exactly what, but at least appreciate that it''s got something. Not sure I like the blowout, but then maybe that is part of what is holding my attention.', '2006-03-02 02:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
