(2195239, 301381, 20324, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Pretty creepy feeling due to the face. Is it a mask? Kind of horror movie scene.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Pretty creepy feeling due to the face. Is it a mask? Kind of horror movie scene.', '2006-03-02 03:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
