(2195306, 301848, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s my favourite! It just perfectly fits the challenge. The colours are splendid and it''s very sharp for that kind of picture. Great framing.</td>', 'It''s my favourite! It just perfectly fits the challenge. The colours are splendid and it''s very sharp for that kind of picture. Great framing.', '2006-03-02 04:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
