(2200799, 301106, 41091, '<td valign="top">Hey it llooks like you have a flash light in a hand bag and then how did u make the gigantic ark?  couldn''t have been her?</td>', 'Hey it llooks like you have a flash light in a hand bag and then how did u make the gigantic ark?  couldn''t have been her?', '2006-03-04 23:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2200803, 301785, 41091, '<td valign="top">awesome possibly best in show (not sure not done voting)... bumping up. 10.  Well executed, no noise, would be interested in the setup.  Critique: the base of the face seems to be almost in the hand... might have been helpful to turn her face more to the side... This is very vERY minor, and I must add that this is better than anything i have ever done.  I can only hope to achieve something like this someday.</td>', 'awesome possibly best in show (not sure not done voting)... bumping up. 10.  Well executed, no noise, would be interested in the setup.  Critique: the base of the face seems to be almost in the hand... might have been helpful to turn her face more to the side... This is very vERY minor, and I must add that this is better than anything i have ever done.  I can only hope to achieve something like this someday.', '2006-03-04 23:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
