(2206612, 301316, 47020, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the expression, and this is nicely painted.  It does strike me as a little blurry, which -- while surely only natural for a human subject, and not very badly so -- still ends up being a bit distracting to me.  Still gets a 7 from me, though.  A tad of cropping off the top might have even gotten it to an 8.</td>', 'I like the composition, the expression, and this is nicely painted.  It does strike me as a little blurry, which -- while surely only natural for a human subject, and not very badly so -- still ends up being a bit distracting to me.  Still gets a 7 from me, though.  A tad of cropping off the top might have even gotten it to an 8.', '2006-03-07 05:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2206616, 300834, 47020, '<td valign="top">excuisite.  Excellent concept, and good execution.  I''d give it a 9.5, but I can''t, so I guess you get lucky and I''ll just give it the benefit of a 10.  :-)</td>', 'excuisite.  Excellent concept, and good execution.  I''d give it a 9.5, but I can''t, so I guess you get lucky and I''ll just give it the benefit of a 10.  :-)', '2006-03-07 05:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2206617, 301592, 47020, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous of your surroundings, but I wish you''d done something a little different with the composition -- having the sundial so close to the center just doesn''t work well for me.</td>', 'I''m jealous of your surroundings, but I wish you''d done something a little different with the composition -- having the sundial so close to the center just doesn''t work well for me.', '2006-03-07 05:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2206620, 301343, 47020, '<td valign="top">wow.  wild and interesting.  nice concept, nicely executed.  I do wish that overlap on the middle at the top wasn''t there so much, but still quite nice.</td>', 'wow.  wild and interesting.  nice concept, nicely executed.  I do wish that overlap on the middle at the top wasn''t there so much, but still quite nice.', '2006-03-07 05:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
