(2209923, 301629, 33535, '<td valign="top">so, my first dq...;( and the score was at 6.3...aaargh<br/>i swear it <b>was</b> taken within the date, but ok i forgot to set the camera date und so i broke the rules...<br/>for those who are interested:<br/>of course i wrote this with my left hand literally inverted...<br/>;P no just kiddin'' i flipped it horizontally.<br/>this technic is called "luminogramm". i was inspired by some painters like picasso, who did this before with other things.<br/>i took the shutter up to 8 sec, wrote the word in totally darkness (btw my username "mephisto", i know the the "i" is missing ;P) and after 7 sec a flash to get the model sharp.<br/>thx evryone for the critic and votes though<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-08 04:21:27.</i></td>', 'so, my first dq...;( and the score was at 6.3...aaarghi swear it was taken within the date, but ok i forgot to set the camera date und so i broke the rules...for those who are interested:of course i wrote this with my left hand literally inverted...;P no just kiddin'' i flipped it horizontally.this technic is called "luminogramm". i was inspired by some painters like picasso, who did this before with other things.i took the shutter up to 8 sec, wrote the word in totally darkness (btw my username "mephisto", i know the the "i" is missing ;P) and after 7 sec a flash to get the model sharp.thx evryone for the critic and votes though', '2006-03-08 03:18:43.000000', '2006-03-08 04:21:27.000000', 0),
