(2209963, 300657, 35974, '<td valign="top">This is a shot of a golf trophey,<br/>The light was provided by a single match.<br/> <br/>The backdrop a tracktop, I don''t have any studio kit.<br/> <br/>This is my best result by a mile i was just trying to get above 50% <br/> <br/>I think the concept could have scored much higher if the photo was better, but hey it''s what i could do.<br/> <br/>A thought I had was to use a real golf club wrap the head in cloth soaked in petrol or something light that then take a swing but i did not have the time to take that on.<br/> <br/>Jezz<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is a shot of a golf trophey,The light was provided by a single match. The backdrop a tracktop, I don''t have any studio kit. This is my best result by a mile i was just trying to get above 50%  I think the concept could have scored much higher if the photo was better, but hey it''s what i could do. A thought I had was to use a real golf club wrap the head in cloth soaked in petrol or something light that then take a swing but i did not have the time to take that on. Jezz ', '2006-03-08 03:47:48.000000', NULL, 0),
