(2211373, 301782, 26633, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by idnic:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the old masters look of this soft light, I hope the voters share my vision.  </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Looks like they didn''t, which is a shame. I gave this one a 9. Only a suggestion of too much light on the gerberas for my taste stopped me adding it to the two 10s I gave.<br/> <br/>Beautiful light on the grapes and the bread and just enough on the bottle and the glass to give some sparkle. I suppose people were looking for neon streaks ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by idnic: I like the old masters look of this soft light, I hope the voters share my vision.    Looks like they didn''t, which is a shame. I gave this one a 9. Only a suggestion of too much light on the gerberas for my taste stopped me adding it to the two 10s I gave. Beautiful light on the grapes and the bread and just enough on the bottle and the glass to give some sparkle. I suppose people were looking for neon streaks ;)', '2006-03-08 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 0),
