(2213878, 301389, 1066, '<td valign="top">Just got back from a business trip this Thursday morning and find out about this!<br/> <br/>Awesome!!!!<br/> <br/>Thanks for everyone who liked the shot!  I had purchased some apples at the grocery store the day before I shot this photo and right before munching out on this one I thought...hmmmmm...it has a really great color and I wonder?<br/> <br/>Thanks again........:-D<br/> <br/>BTW....that was a goof kiwiness...I shot this with my Nikon D2x :-O<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-09 09:18:59.</i></td>', 'Just got back from a business trip this Thursday morning and find out about this! Awesome!!!! Thanks for everyone who liked the shot!  I had purchased some apples at the grocery store the day before I shot this photo and right before munching out on this one I thought...hmmmmm...it has a really great color and I wonder? Thanks again........:-D BTW....that was a goof kiwiness...I shot this with my Nikon D2x :-O', '2006-03-09 09:17:50.000000', '2006-03-09 09:18:59.000000', 0),
