(2214422, 301785, 39349, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic shot! I didn''t get a chance to comment on this while voting but I''m one of those 25 tens you received while voting. I love everything about this shot. Composition is wonderful, I like the tones from dark to light. IMO, you''ve nailed this challenge! Well done!</td>', 'What a fantastic shot! I didn''t get a chance to comment on this while voting but I''m one of those 25 tens you received while voting. I love everything about this shot. Composition is wonderful, I like the tones from dark to light. IMO, you''ve nailed this challenge! Well done!', '2006-03-09 13:17:49.000000', NULL, 0),
