(2239749, 301785, 31606, '<td valign="top">This was the photo that caused all the ruckus.  Well I really liked this shot either way.  The only problems I have is I think you have too much black space up top and if you wouldn;t have cut off her toes or elbows I would have given you a 9 had I voted in this challenge.  The reason I say 9 is because the arm is in the way for a 10. :-)<br/> <br/>Wonderful and creative you were with this one and a well deserved 7th place.</td>', 'This was the photo that caused all the ruckus.  Well I really liked this shot either way.  The only problems I have is I think you have too much black space up top and if you wouldn;t have cut off her toes or elbows I would have given you a 9 had I voted in this challenge.  The reason I say 9 is because the arm is in the way for a 10. :-) Wonderful and creative you were with this one and a well deserved 7th place.', '2006-03-19 19:06:30.000000', NULL, 0),
