(2281717, 301197, 56465, '<td valign="top">I have to admit...I''m flattered. You should try to play up the diffusion part a bit more.  Part of what makes my toy pix work is the way they drift in and out of focus. You might want to try shaping the background light to play off the swoopy shape of the car.<br/>Most of all...keep having fun.<br/>-Allan Weitz</td>', 'I have to admit...I''m flattered. You should try to play up the diffusion part a bit more.  Part of what makes my toy pix work is the way they drift in and out of focus. You might want to try shaping the background light to play off the swoopy shape of the car.Most of all...keep having fun.-Allan Weitz', '2006-04-03 00:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
