(4313514, 301264, 52773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jml:</b></div><hr/><i> Very cool image, very creative idea. Are you going to tell us how you can span 2+ minutes of time with a 30 second exposure? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL! That was easy! I just manually changed the time while i was moving the clock. Like that, when i left the clock still for a couple of seconds it was a different time.</td>', 'Originally posted by jml: Very cool image, very creative idea. Are you going to tell us how you can span 2+ minutes of time with a 30 second exposure?   LOL! That was easy! I just manually changed the time while i was moving the clock. Like that, when i left the clock still for a couple of seconds it was a different time.', '2007-12-13 18:50:21.000000', NULL, 0),
